      "sha": "7699483827b24e958772d10b363e087e1f4173c4",
      "message": "fix(i18n): fix faulty remap of mde tooltips (#14804)\n\nFixes forgejo/forgejo#14357.\n\nFix regression of https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13954.\n\nThis re-remaps strings correctly in all languages as they were of commit f911f069b7fc7f3ed65b8ef3f9b12719c99d0757.\n\nThis rollback is needed because we currently have a mix of languages that were and weren't updated on Weblate.\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14804\nReviewed-by: Gusted <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
